### 1. Analyze Intent
This test verifies that a `Maybe` monad can be constructed with `None` and a boolean flag, that calling `.map()` on it with a set works without error, and that a second `Maybe` constructed with an integer value can be converted to an `Either` type via `.to_either()`.

