<final_code>
```python
def test_maybe_false_false_supports_eq_and_conversion_chain():
    """Test that a Maybe(False, False) supports self-equality and can be converted via to_try() then to_validation()."""
    # Construct a Maybe instance with both values set to False
    false_value = False
    maybe_instance = maybe.Maybe(false_value, false_value)

    # Perform equality comparison of the instance with itself (result captured, not asserted)
    eq_result = maybe_instance.__eq__(maybe_instance)

    # Convert the Maybe to a Try type, then further to a Validation type
    try_result = maybe_instance.to_try()
    try_result.to_validation()
```
